          "text": "by the prophet Haggai, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak now to Zerubbabel the son of Shealtiel, governor of Judah, and to Joshua the son of Josedech, the high priest, and to the residue of the people, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "left among you that saw this house in her first glory? and how do ye see it now?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not in your eyes in comparison of it as nothing?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet now be strong, O Zerubbabel, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and be strong, O Joshua, son of Josedech, the high priest; and be strong, all ye people of the land, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and work: for I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with you, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "According to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the word that I covenanted with you when ye came out of Egypt, so my spirit remaineth among you: fear ye not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts; Yet once, it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a little while, and I will shake the heavens, and the earth, and the sea, and the dry",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "land;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will shake all nations, and the desire of all nations shall come: and I will fill this house with glory, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HAG.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HAG.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
